            <ul>
                <li><b>Duration:</b> ~1h 15m air time, but total journey often 3-4 hours, including airport procedures</li>
                <li><b>Comfort:</b> Standard airplane seating; limited legroom and amenities for short flights</li>
                <li><b>Flexibility:</b> Multiple daily flights between STL and ORD/MDW, but airport transfers are required to/from city centers</li>
                <li><b>Pros:</b> Fastest in air time</li>
                <li><b>Cons:</b> Airport check-in, security, TSA lines; travel to/from airports adds significant time; less scenic; higher carbon footprint; ORD/MDW are far from downtown Chicago.</li>
            </ul>

